<title>USA: North American Mortgage July loans up.</title>
<headline>North American Mortgage July loans up.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ROSA, Calif. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>North American Mortgage Co Thursday reported July loan fundings rose 20 percent to $805 million versus $708 million one year ago.</p>
<p>Loan applications in July were $1.6 billion, a 38 percent increase from $1.2 billion in July 1996.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said refinancings amounted to 26 percent of total fundings and 36 percent of total applications for July 1997.</p>
</text>
